  m_text: "Our Journey:\n\n\"The soul of pool, reimagined. We\u2019ve traded the
    cue stick for the flick and the long board for a rotating arena, creating a smarter,
    faster way to play.\"\n\nEnjoying the game?\nIf you\u2019re having fun, we\u2019d
    really appreciate your support!\n\nRate us on the Play Store\nYour feedback helps
    us reach more players \nand improve the experience.\n\r\r"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5302535af1044152a457ed104f1f4b91, type: 2}
